  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In The Legends of Ren Zu, a snowman claims to have conquered the bright light glorious ring fire in the sky, along with the azure divine stone furnace fire in the earth and the raging wave rising dragon fire in the sea. The snowman later names the heat of bright light glorious ring fire when comparing other fires.",
      "chapters": [
        1229
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "legend-of-the-sky",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The three flames of heaven, earth, and human are the heaven flame bright light glorious ring fire, the earth flame azure divine stone furnace fire, and the human flame raging wave rising dragon fire. They are rank nine unique flames of heaven, earth, and human.",
      "chapters": [
        2108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heaven-flame-of-three",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the sun collapses, fire path resources scatter onto the five regions as fire rain, most common in Western Desert and least in Eastern Sea because of dao mark conflict. Bright light glorious ring fire makes up most of those flames; it is the heaven flame of the three flames in the world and a rank nine fire path immortal material. At least a rank eight fire path great expert is needed to deal with it.",
      "chapters": [
        2278
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-rain-from-the-sun",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The material is extremely rare and barely found elsewhere, so the collapse is a prime chance to gather a huge amount. On a Heaven and Earth Great Love Alliance exchange list for fire path immortal materials, bright light glorious ring fire sits at the top and can exchange for the most contribution points.",
      "chapters": [
        2278
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
